# 🎓 SUGSMS - Application Management System

SUGSMS (Shobhit University Graduate Student Management System) is a web-based application to manage student applications. Admins can review, accept, reject, delete, and restore applications based on status filters.

## ✨ Features

* View all student applications with details
* Filter applications by status:

  * Pending
  * Accepted
  * Rejected
  * Deleted
* Perform actions:

  * ✅ Accept application
  * ❌ Reject application
  * 🗑️ Soft delete application
  * 🔁 Revert to pending status
* Mobile responsive layout
* Alert confirmations for all critical actions

## 🛠 Tech Stack

* **Backend**: Node.js, Express.js
* **Templating Engine**: EJS
* **Database**: MongoDB (Mongoose)
* **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
* **Deployment**: Any Node-compatible server (e.g. Render, Heroku)

## 📁 Folder Structure

```
project-root/
├── views/                   # EJS templates
│   └── applications.ejs
├── public/                  # Static files (CSS, JS, images)
├── routes/                  # Express route handlers
│   └── admin.js
├── models/                  # Mongoose models
│   └── Application.js
├── app.js                   # Main Express app
├── .env                     # Environment variables (Mongo URI, etc.)
├── .gitignore
└── README.md
```

## ✨ Setup Instructions

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/sugsms.git
cd sugsms
```

### 2. Install dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

### 3. Configure environment

Create a `.env` file in the root directory and add:

```
MONGODB_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
PORT=5000
```

### 4. Run the server

```bash
npm start
```

Visit `http://localhost:5000/admin/applications`

## 🔐 Admin Routes Overview

| Route                            | Method | Description                |
| -------------------------------- | ------ | -------------------------- |
| `/admin/applications`            | GET    | List all applications      |
| `/admin/applications?status=...` | GET    | Filter by status           |
| `/admin/applications/:id/accept` | POST   | Accept an application      |
| `/admin/applications/:id/reject` | POST   | Reject an application      |
| `/admin/applications/:id/delete` | POST   | Soft delete an application |
| `/admin/applications/:id/revert` | POST   | Revert to pending          |

